Green Audio Player 1.1.2
https://github.com/greghub/green-audio-player

The browser source and compiled CSS are included locally because the npm package
requires node-sass 4 and its obsolete native build toolchain at runtime.
The MIT license is in green-audio-player.LICENSE.

Upstream Git blob hashes:
src/js/main.js: 91693301b87dd8422e18dd76917850d75b68b373
dist/css/green-audio-player.css: c004d96474ba4037a4da355827e6d50b032ac274

Local changes fix touch drag targets, release global listeners when replacing or
closing a player, handle rejected play promises, and preserve localized playback
labels. CSS remains upstream;
the explorer's own styles supply its theme and responsive layout.
